# POMBuilder's own notebook cache (default `irDir`). Regenerable local IR state from
# running the crawler against a live site, analogous to a build cache - never meant to
# be committed, in this repo or in a project that depends on POMBuilder.
.pombuilder/

# Internal design and planning documents. Working material, not part of the
# published project - deliberately kept out of the repository. These live on
# disk locally; `git rm --cached` untracked them, and these entries stop them
# being re-added by a `git add -A`.
POMBuilder-design-v1.md
docs/superpowers/plans/POMBuilder-design-v1.md
docs/superpowers/plans/POMBuilder-v1-remediation.md
